@@ -0,0 +1,88 @@
+/*
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
+ * Copyright (c) Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. 2026-2026. All rights reserved.
+ * Description: realize func for umq dfx api
+ * Create: 2026-2-4
